Licensing index
===============

Application and business code, examples, C ABI headers, Python bindings, build
scripts, and documentation authored for this project are designated Apache-2.0.
See LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.

APLUX-authored proprietary SDK implementation contributions in the precompiled SDK library are
covered by LICENSES/Pandora-Model-SDK.zh-CN.txt and its English translation.
The agreement applies only to rights APLUX owns or is authorized to license.
It does not replace or revoke upstream or third-party permissions. Binary form
or quantization does not by itself establish proprietary rights.

Model weights and tokenizer data are distributed separately and retain their
applicable upstream terms. This SDK includes Qualcomm Genie linked into
sdk/lib/libhy_mt2.so and unchanged Qualcomm QNN user-space runtime libraries in
sdk/lib/qnn248/. These components retain their supplier and open-source terms;
see sdk/lib/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt, sdk/lib/LICENSES/ and sdk/lib/qnn248/.
Device BSP/drivers, AidLMS, FastRPC, DSP firmware and basic system libraries are
external device prerequisites and are not bundled. They retain their own terms.

This repository includes public Python source, C ABI headers and the paired
precompiled sdk/lib/libhy_mt2.so, together with its licensing files. The native
C/C++ implementation and private build inputs are not part of this delivery.
